 plane????',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-07-07 07:26:24'),(79,19,'instagram',NULL,'_schecki',NULL,NULL,'Well, 1. That is no Geiger counter but a quite sensitive scintilation counter. 2. Radium ore is dangerous. Because that dose rate come from alpha/beta and is close to your body if you play around with it. Not comparable with the gamma dose you get in a plane. And 3. downplaying radiation in that way is only a sign of insufficient knowledge - especially if doing videos on social media where the downplaying is picked up by uneducated people easily.',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-07-07 07:26:24'),(80,19,'instagram',NULL,'elder_dingus',NULL,NULL,'Uranium ore is worth more than gold',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-07-07 07:26:24'),(81,19,'instagram',NULL,'elder_dingus',NULL,NULL,'elder_dingusVerified',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-07-07 07:26:24'),(82,19,'instagram',NULL,'troy_05_tone',NULL,NULL,'-1hp -1hp-1hp-1hp-1hp-1hp-1hp',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-07-07 07:26:24'),(83,19,'instagram',NULL,'andrew_pap_',NULL,NULL,'Anytime I feel intellectually accomplished…. I’ll walk myself out the door. 😂',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-07-07 07:26:24'),(84,19,'instagram',NULL,'andrew_pap_',NULL,NULL,'andrew_pap_Verified',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-07-07 07:26:24'),(85,19,'instagram',NULL,'mattwylds',NULL,NULL,'What happens if you eat it?',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-07-07 07:26:24'),(86,19,'instagram',NULL,'fabio89villaxa',NULL,NULL,'nice explanation',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-07-07 07:26:24'),(87,19,'instagram',NULL,'haleylarr',NULL,NULL,'I want to eat it',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-07-07 07:26:24'),(88,19,'instagram',NULL,'dcd.wayne',NULL,NULL,'I am an Alpha then... Woah, everyday you learn something new. I got it',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-07-07 07:26:24'),(89,19,'instagram',NULL,'aggeloslefkaditis8',NULL,NULL,'King how does this relate to nuclear reactors?',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-07-07 07:26:24'),(90,19,'instagram',NULL,'s.hall.__',NULL,NULL,'@hockeygoalie_21 yeah that’s wh