from news.iinn',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-07-07 13:08:39'),(984,133,'instagram',NULL,'popular',NULL,NULL,'Popular',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-07-07 13:08:39'),(985,134,'instagram',NULL,'mal.ntl.lab',NULL,NULL,'Also from Meta',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-07-07 13:08:54'),(986,134,'instagram',NULL,'priyadharshini_ece',NULL,NULL,'priyadharshini_ece 17wA hypersonic missile travels at speeds greater than Mach 5.What does that mean?Mach 1 = speed of sound ≈ 1,235 km/h (767 mph) at sea level.Mach 5 = about 6,175 km/h (3,836 mph).So hypersonic missiles typically fly between Mach 5 and Mach 20.Typical speedsMach 5 → ~6,000 km/hMach 10 → ~12,000 km/hMach 20 → ~24,000 km/hExamplesKh-47M2 Kinzhal – around Mach 10Avangard – up to Mach 20–27DF-17 – about Mach 5–10Why hypersonic missiles are dangerous 🚀Extremely fast – very little reaction timeManeuverable – can change direction mid-flightHard to intercept by most current missile defense systemsAt Mach 10, a missile could travel roughly 1 km in about 0.3 seconds.#missile #hypersonicmissile #war #explorepage #learning',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-07-07 13:08:54'),(987,134,'instagram',NULL,'priyadharshini_ece',NULL,NULL,'More posts from priyadharshini_ece',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-07-07 13:08:54'),(988,134,'instagram',NULL,'popular',NULL,NULL,'Popular',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-07-07 13:08:54'),(989,135,'instagram',NULL,'mal.ntl.lab',NULL,NULL,'Also from Meta',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-07-07 08:09:19'),(990,135,'instagram',NULL,'daily_loud',NULL,NULL,'daily_loudVerified 18wBREAKING: Iran has fired its Fattah‑2 hypersonic missile, capable of speeds over 11,000 mph 🤯Does this frighten you?? 👀🤔Drop your comments below ⬇️Praying for peace 🙏#iran #usa #israel #unitedstates #hypersonicmissile',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-07-07 08:09:19'),(991,135,'instagram',NULL,'taylormaglin',NULL,NULL,'Please pray for peace…. Otherwise we might be cooked 🙏',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-07-07 08:09:19'),(992,135,'instagram',NULL,'thenotoriousiz