ccupied Jammu and Kashmir (IIOJK), and reaffirmed Pakistan\'s commitment to safeguarding its sovereignty, national interests, and regional peace.📍 GHQ, Rawalpindi📅 6 July 2026#AsimMunir #PakistanArmy #GHQ #Rawalpindi #NationalUpdatesPK',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-07-07 11:14:14'),(2486,259,'instagram',NULL,'muhammad_adil3115',NULL,NULL,'❤️❤️',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-07-07 11:14:14'),(2487,259,'instagram',NULL,'pakarmy_00786',NULL,NULL,'❤️❤️❤️❤️',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-07-07 11:14:14'),(2488,259,'instagram',NULL,'195_imran',NULL,NULL,'❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-07-07 11:14:14'),(2489,259,'instagram',NULL,'khanbazoon',NULL,NULL,'Mashallh Syed Asim munir zindabad Pakistan hamesha zindabad mashallh ❤️❤️❤️',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-07-07 11:14:14'),(2490,259,'instagram',NULL,'irukh13',NULL,NULL,'Pakistan Army Forever💕',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-07-07 11:14:14'),(2491,259,'instagram',NULL,'abu_bakar9217',NULL,NULL,'❤️❤️❤️❤️hero',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-07-07 11:14:14'),(2492,259,'instagram',NULL,'talat_hussain_2010',NULL,NULL,'Pakistan Hamesha Zindabad❤🇵🇰 Pakistan Army Zindabad❤🇵🇰 PM Shehbaz Sharif SAHAB❤Asim Munir shbZindabad',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-07-07 11:14:14'),(2493,259,'instagram',NULL,'ashirwad965',NULL,NULL,'Counting the pak aircrafts loss in op sindoor',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-07-07 11:14:14'),(2494,259,'instagram',NULL,'turab_kazmi',NULL,NULL,'corps commander lahore is our relative a little far but is',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-07-07 11:14:14'),(2495,259,'instagram',NULL,'khalidkhanmkd45',NULL,NULL,'اللہ کے فضل و کرم سے ساری وردی تمغوں سے بھری ہے لیکن غیرت نام کی کوئی چیز ہی نہیں ان دلوں میں',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-07-07 11:14:14'),(2496,259,'instagram',NULL,'nationalupdatespk',NULL,NULL,'More posts from nationalupdatespk',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-07-07 11:14:14'),(2497,259,'instagram',NULL,'popular',NULL,NULL,'Popular',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-07-07 11:14:14'),(2498,260,'instagram',NULL,'mal.ntl.la