d Swords, Crowns, and Chevrons)​A visual top-to-bottom hierarchy​Whether you are an aspiring officer preparing for the ISSB/CSS exams or a proud citizen who loves the armed forces, this guide is for you! 📚🦅​👇 WHICH RANK INSPIRES YOU THE MOST? COMMENT BELOW',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-07-07 16:18:21'),(2587,265,'instagram',NULL,'sierramikealpha',NULL,NULL,'I aspire to be a Capt someday',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-07-07 16:18:21'),(2588,265,'instagram',NULL,'muhammadhamza6382',NULL,NULL,'Where is Karnal',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-07-07 16:18:21'),(2589,265,'instagram',NULL,'tamgo_mike',NULL,NULL,'Wrong Depiction of the Pak Army Ranks',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-07-07 16:18:21'),(2590,265,'instagram',NULL,'syed__baqir7',NULL,NULL,'Bhai konse nashe keye hai',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-07-07 16:18:21'),(2591,265,'instagram',NULL,'qureshi.x.sindhi12',NULL,NULL,'Glt ha',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-07-07 16:18:21'),(2592,265,'instagram',NULL,'a.k.khan0310',NULL,NULL,'Bhae sahi to banaya kr ulta phulta krdiya hai sb',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-07-07 16:18:21'),(2593,265,'instagram',NULL,'umar_aqiq',NULL,NULL,'Ghalat btaya wa ha yeh sab',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-07-07 16:18:21'),(2594,265,'instagram',NULL,'umar_aqiq',NULL,NULL,'umar_aqiqVerified',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-07-07 16:18:21'),(2595,265,'instagram',NULL,'qureshi.x.sindhi12',NULL,NULL,'Wrong',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-07-07 16:18:21'),(2596,265,'instagram',NULL,'girlslover15457',NULL,NULL,'یہ سبھی سائن غلط ہیں ایسے نہیں ہوتے',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-07-07 16:18:21'),(2597,265,'instagram',NULL,'ali_alam_17',NULL,NULL,'Wrong ranks',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-07-07 16:18:21'),(2598,265,'instagram',NULL,'kash_hello',NULL,NULL,'Bullet proof jacket khanzeer sahooni dalal Asim munir',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-07-07 16:18:21'),(2599,265,'instagram',NULL,'iambilal.m',NULL,NULL,'Absolutely fucking wrong.',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-07-07 16:18:21'),(2600,265,'instagram',NULL,'kash_hello',NULL,NULL,'Muna