,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-07-07 16:21:54'),(2618,267,'instagram',NULL,'shhhoaib_',NULL,NULL,'In my opinion, the primary value of this internship lies in the association with ISPR and the certificate awarded upon completion. Based on my experience as a participant in the previous summer internship program, the majority of the sessions focused on presentations and lectures about the Pakistan Army rather than practical, skill-oriented training. While the program provides exposure to the organization, it offers limited opportunities for developing technical skills or gaining hands-on professional experience. As a result, I found that the time, travel, and effort invested did not translate into significant learning or career growth.',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-07-07 16:21:54'),(2619,267,'instagram',NULL,'a_s_m_aaaaaaaaa',NULL,NULL,'Where is the contact channel to apply individually?',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-07-07 16:21:54'),(2620,267,'instagram',NULL,'she_is.amal',NULL,NULL,'Need reference for it?',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-07-07 16:21:54'),(2621,267,'instagram',NULL,'nub.199',NULL,NULL,'Nutrition and food sciences student eligible?',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-07-07 16:21:54'),(2622,267,'instagram',NULL,'http_noor11',NULL,NULL,'What about transportation????',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-07-07 16:21:54'),(2623,267,'instagram',NULL,'itxm_avi',NULL,NULL,'Jinki uni ny inform ni Kiya?',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-07-07 16:21:54'),(2624,267,'instagram',NULL,'itxm_avi',NULL,NULL,'2w · Edited',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-07-07 16:21:54'),(2625,267,'instagram',NULL,'wo.lf4344',NULL,NULL,'Sir agar koi select ho jaye to kiya karna parre ga koi idea nhii ha please sir help kare',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-07-07 16:21:54'),(2626,267,'instagram',NULL,'haya._.licious_',NULL,NULL,'Medical field sy related koi internship btadian',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-07-07 16:21:54'),(2627,267,'instagram',NULL,'zhoosh_x',NULL,NULL,'Multan m Hain y',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-07-07 16:2