tioning laser air defense drones and close-range aerial threats',NULL,'2026-07-07 12:29:38','2026-07-07 07:29:49','2026-07-09 09:41:16'),(33,'instagram','https://www.instagram.com/p/DY_MfWzvkii/','DY_MfWzvkii','video',NULL,'factonomics',NULL,NULL,'🌍 World’s Most Powerful Nuclear Bombs: India 🇮🇳 vs USA 🇺🇸 vs Russia 🇷🇺 vs China 🇨🇳\n\nNuclear weapons remain one of the most significant elements of global military deterrence. This comparison highlights some of the most powerful nuclear warheads and delivery systems associated with four major nuclear powers. From India\'s Shakti series to Russia\'s legendary Tsar Bomba, each represents a different era of nuclear technology, strategy, and national defense capabilities.\n\n⚠️ While explosive yield often attracts attention, modern military strength depends on many factors, including missile accuracy, delivery systems, survivability, command structures, and deterrence doctrine. Today\'s nuclear powers focus more on strategic deterrence than sheer destructive force.\n\n📊 In this comparison: ✅ Explosive Yield\n✅ Thermonuclear Technology\n✅ Delivery Systems\n✅ Size & Weight\n✅ Operational Status\n✅ Historical Significance\n\nRussia\'s Tsar Bomba remains the most powerful nuclear device ever tested, while the USA\'s B83 remains one of the most powerful operational gravity bombs. China continues to modernize its strategic arsenal with systems like the DF-41, and India maintains a credible nuclear deterrent through its Agni missile program.\n\n💬 Which country do you think has the most effective nuclear deterrence strategy? Share your thoughts below!\n\n#NuclearWeapons #MilitaryPower #India #USA #Russia China DefenseTechnology NuclearDeterrence WorldMilitary Geopolitics StrategicForces MissileTechnology MilitaryComparison GlobalSecurity DefenseAnalysis MilitaryFacts NuclearArsenal WorldAffairs DefenseNews InternationalRelations\n\nNuclear Bombs, Nuclear Weapons, India Nuclear Program, USA Military, Russia Tsar Bomba, China DF41, Thermonuclear Bomb, Military Comparison, Strategic Deterrence, Ballistic Missile, Nuclear Arsenal, Defense Technology, Global Security, Geopolitics, Military Power Ranking',1,'2026-05-31 05:00:00',8204,132,NULL,NULL,'neutral',0.8,'[]','[\"factonomics\"]','[]','[\"nuclear weapons\", \"missile defense\", \"naval\", \"military\"]','en','llama3.2:latest',93,'The post provides a detailed comparison of nuclear warheads and delivery systems from four major nuclear powers, highlighting their capabilities, strategies, and historical significance.','{\"source\": \"yt-dlp\"}','2026-07-07 07:28:25','2026-07-07 07:30:07','2026-07-09 09:41:17'),(34,'instagram','https://www.instagram.com/p/DYP7N3iPgum/','DYP7N3iPgum','video',NULL,'Warzone',NULL,NULL,'The backbone of Algerian Air Force isn’t a Western fighter… it’s one of the most advanced Flankers ever exported by Russia — the mighty Sukhoi Su-30MKA🇩🇿✈️\n\nDerived from the legendary Su-30 family, the Su-30MKA was specially customized for Algeria, combining the long-range strike capability of the Su-30MKI with French and Russian avionics tailored to Algerian requirements. The result is a heavyweight multirole fighter capable of dominating both air-to-air and air-to-ground missions across North Africa’s vast desert regions.\n\nPowered by twin AL-31FP thrust-vectoring engines, the Su-30MKA can perform extreme supermaneuverable moves like the Cobra and Kulbit while carrying a massive weapons load. With a combat radius exceeding many Western fighters, these jets give Algeria one of the strongest air forces on the African continent.\n\nThe aircraft is equipped with the powerful N011M Bars radar, capable of tracking multiple targets simultaneously while engaging both aerial and ground threats. From R-77 beyond-visual-range missiles to Kh-31 anti-ship and anti-radiation weapons, the Su-30MKA can adapt to nearly any combat role.\n\nAlgeria began receiving the Su-30MKA in the mid-2000s as part of a major modernization effort, gradually turning the country into one of Russia’s biggest African defense partners. Today, the fleet forms the spearhead of Algeria’s air superiority and strategic deterrence capability.\n\nWhat makes the Su-30MKA especially intimidating is its combination of range, payload, agility, and endurance. Unlike lighter fighters designed purely for interception, this Flanker can patrol enormous distances over the Sahara, escort strike packages, launch precision attacks, and still fight for air dominance if challenged.\n\nIn many ways, the Su-30MKA represents the perfect balance between a heavy interceptor and a modern strike fighter — a true “air dominance truck” built for power projection across Africa and the Mediterranean.\n.\n.\n.\n.\n#Su30MKA #Su30 #aviationgeeks #algerianairforce #aviation',1,'2026-05-12 05:00:00',7158,328,NULL,NULL,'neutral',0.8,'[]','[\"Algeria\", \"Russia\"]','[\"North Africa\", \"Africa\"]','[\"military\", \"missile defense\", \"naval\", \"nuclear\"]','en','llama3.2:latest',71,'The post provides detailed information on the capabilities and features of the Sukhoi Su-30MKA aircraft, which is a strategic asset for Algeria\'s military','{\"source\": \"yt-dlp\"}','2026-07-07 07:29:19','2026-07-07 07:30:07','2026-07-09 09:41:18'),(35,'facebook','https://www.facebook.com/watch/hashtag/eidmubarakeveryone/',NULL,'image',NULL,'Pakistan Army Information',NULL,NULL,'ہمارا مسکرانا بس درد کو چھپانے کا بہانہ ہے',NULL,NULL,385,0,0,NULL,'negative',-0.5,'[\"Pakistan\"]','[\"Pakistan Army Information\"]','[\"Pakistan\"]','[\"military\", \"defence\"]','ur','llama3.2:latest',46,'The post discusses Pakistan\'s military capabilities and its relationship with its people, but lacks specific details about missile defense or naval capabilities',NULL,'2026-07-07 07:30:12','2026-07-07 07:30:41','2026-07-09 09:41:18'),(36,'facebook',NULL,NULL,'image',NULL,'Pakistan war vision',NULL,NULL,'جو وطن کی طرف میلی آنکھ سے دیکھے، اسے ہماری فولادی دیوار جواب دیتی ہے۔… See more',NULL,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,'n