tween Mach 5 and Mach 20.\nTypical speeds\nMach 5 → ~6,000 km/h\nMach 10 → ~12,000 km/h\nMach 20 → ~24,000 km/h\nExamples\nKh-47M2 Kinzhal – around Mach 10\nAvangard – up to Mach 20–27\nDF-17 – about Mach 5–10\nWhy hypersonic missiles are dangerous 🚀\nExtremely fast – very little reaction time\nManeuverable – can change direction mid-flight\nHard to intercept by most current missile defense systems\nAt Mach 10, a missile could travel roughly 1 km in about 0.3 seconds.\n\n#missile #hypersonicmissile #war #explorepage #learning',1,'2026-03-07 05:00:00',688,2,NULL,NULL,'neutral',0.8,'[]','[\"Er.priyadharshini\"]','[]','[\"missile defense\", \"hypersonic missiles\"]','en','llama3.2:latest',71,'The post provides a clear explanation of hypersonic missile speeds and their implications for missile defense systems','{\"source\": \"yt-dlp\"}','2026-07-07 08:08:44','2026-07-07 08:11:11','2026-07-09 09:42:24'),(135,'instagram','https://www.instagram.com/p/DVaV5HvDt9m/','DVaV5HvDt9m','video',NULL,'Daily Loud',NULL,NULL,'BREAKING: Iran has fired its Fattah‑2 hypersonic missile, capable of speeds over 11,000 mph 🤯\n\nDoes this frighten you?? 👀🤔\nDrop your comments below ⬇️\n\nPraying for peace 🙏\n\n#iran #usa #israel #unitedstates #hypersonicmissile',1,'2026-03-03 05:00:00',6751,526,NULL,NULL,'negative',-0.5,'[]','[\"Iran\", \"USA\"]','[\"Iran\"]','[\"missile defense\", \"hypersonic missiles\"]','en','llama3.2:latest',71,'The post directly mentions a specific type of missile and its capabilities, indicating a clear understanding of the subject matter relevant to missile defense','{\"source\": \"yt-dlp\"}','2026-07-07 08:09:07','2026-07-07 08:11:11','2026-07-09 09:42:25'),(136,'instagram','https://www.instagram.com/p/DVZTwfYE3vd/','DVZTwfYE3vd','video',NULL,'amam',NULL,NULL,'Iran unveils the Fattah-2, a next-gen hypersonic missile capable of extreme speed and maneuverability, reshaping the future of modern warfare and air-defense challenges.\n\n#Fattah2 #HypersonicMissile #IranMili