thing.\nAgni, the sacred witness. 🔥✨\nYour prayers are already on their way.\n\n#agni #vedicgods #vedicmythology #sacredfire #divineart \n.\n.\n.\naiart aiartist hinduism spiritualawakening cosmicart sacredgeometry fireoffering manifestation homa divinedeity soulawakening vedas sacredflame prayerworks ancientwisdom',NULL,'2026-06-20 05:00:00',423,13,NULL,NULL,'neutral',-0.5,'[]','[]','[]','[\"Hinduism\", \"Vedic mythology\"]','en','llama3.2:latest',46,'The post mentions \'Agni\', a Vedic god associated with fire and sacred witness, but lacks direct connection to military, missile defense, naval, or nuclear topics.','{\"source\": \"yt-dlp\"}','2026-07-08 04:43:02','2026-07-08 04:45:39','2026-07-09 09:44:05'),(291,'instagram','https://www.instagram.com/p/C9w_-doyDLI/','C9w_-doyDLI','video',NULL,'Joginder Tuteja',NULL,NULL,'Ferocious to the fire, here is the #Agni song from #Surya’s #Kanguva, which has been rightfully titled #TheFire 🔥🔥🔥\n\n#KanguvaFromOct10 🦅',NULL,'2024-07-23 05:00:00',76,1,NULL,NULL,'neutral',-1,'[]','[]','[]','[\"music\", \"Bollywood\"]','en','llama3.2:latest',0,'The post is about a song from a Bollywood movie and does not mention military, missile defense, naval, or nuclear topics at all.','{\"source\": \"yt-dlp\"}','2026-07-08 04:43:31','2026-07-08 04:45:39','2026-07-09 09:44:05'),(292,'instagram','https://www.instagram.com/p/DYHmyeSlWpk/','DYHmyeSlWpk','video',NULL,'The Ayurvedic Institute',NULL,NULL,'What does agni actually do in your body?\n\nIn the classical teaching, agni is the fire that turns food into the body, and the body into awareness.\n\nIt is the enzyme of digestion in your stomach, the metabolism in every tissue, the intelligence by which your cells know what to receive and what to release.\n\nWhen agni is strong, it produces ojas, the vital essence that becomes your immunity.\n\nIt preserves prana, the life-breath. And it gives rise to tejas, the inner light that shows up as glow, vitality, and clarity of perception.\n\nAgni is the intelligence by which food becomes consciousness.\n\nThis is why the classical texts call it the mainstay of life.\n\nThe word agni itself holds the whole teaching. A-G-N-I.\n\nEach letter names a distinct function of this fire.\n\nJoin us today for Awakening Agni, a live masterclass led by Dr. Lad.\n\nHe takes you through all four functions of agni and the practices that keep this fire steady through every season.\n\nIf you cannot join us live, a recording will be sent after.\n\nComment \"AGNI\" in the comments to receive the details.\n\n#ayurveda #agni #ayurvedicinstitute #drvasantlad #digestion',NULL,'2026-05-09 05:00:00',611,103,NULL,NULL,'neutral',-0.2,'[]','[\"The Ayurvedic Institute\"]','[]','[\"Ayurveda\", \"digestion\"]','en','llama3.2:latest',46,'The post discusses the concept of agni in Ayurvedic teachings, which is loosely related to the strategic keyword \'agni\' as it refers to a digestive fire, but lacks direct connection to military or missile defense topics.','{\"source\": \"yt-dlp\"}','2026-07-08 09:43:40','2026-07-08 04:45:39','2026-07-09 09:44:06'),(293,'instagram','https://www.instagram.com/p/DVVylxviYFt/','DVVylxviYFt','video',NULL,'Dr.Sayali Devkate',NULL,NULL,'3 Signs Your Agni Is Weak (That You’re Ignoring)\n\nIn Ayurveda, Agni is not just digestion.\nIt is the power of transformation inside your body.\n\nWhen Agni is strong → food becomes energy, glow, immunity, clarity.\nWhen Agni is weak → food becomes Ama (toxins).\n\nAnd most people ignore the early signs.\n\nHere are 3 subtle indicators:\n\n1)Coated Tongue in the Morning\n\nIf your tongue has a thick white coating daily, it’s a sign of Ama accumulation.\n\nYour tongue reflects your gut health.\nIf digestion is incomplete at night, residue shows up in the morning.\n\nScraping removes the coating —\nbut correcting Agni removes the cause.\n\n2) Bloating After Simple Meals\n\nIf even home-cooked dal–rice makes you feel heavy, gassy, or uncomfortable — the issue is not the food.\n\nIt’s Mandagni (low digestive fire).\n\nCommon causes:\n• Late dinners\n• Eating while stressed\n• Cold drinks with meals\n• Constant snacking\n\nStrong Agni gives lightness after meals, not heaviness.\n\n3)Energy Crash at 3–4 PM\n\nIf you crave tea, coffee, or sugar every afternoon — your lunch is not converting into stable energy.\n\nThat dip is often incomplete digestion.\n\nStimulation is not nourishment.\n\nAccording to Ayurveda:\n“Rogah Sarve Api Mande Agnou”\nMost diseases begin with weak Agni.\n\nBefore focusing on supplements, skincare, or haircare \nstabilize your digestion.\n\nHealing starts in the gut.\n\n#trendingnow #explorepage #ayurveda #fp #reelsindia',NULL,'2026-03-01 05:00:00',170,11,NULL,NULL,'neutral',-0.5,'[]','[]','[]','[\"Ayurveda\", \"digestion\"]','en','llama3.2:latest',46,'The post discusses Ayurvedic principles related to digestion and energy, which is loosely related to the strategic keywords of military, missile defense, and naval, but does not directly address these topics.','{\"source\": \"yt-dlp\"}','2026-07-08 09:43:57','2026-07-08 04:45:39','2026-07-09 09:44:07'),(294,'instagram','https://www.instagram.com/p/CkkkvVKrZdT/','CkkkvVKrZdT','video',NULL,'Mirchi Bangla',NULL,NULL,'we\'re overwhelmed and so is @mirchiagni ❤️\nstay tuned...\n\n#mirchiagni #agnisdateout #agni #agnidateout #datewithmirchiagni #date #brandcampaign #mirchibangla',NULL,'2022-11-05 05:00:00',3025,17,NULL,NULL,'negative',-1,'[\"Mirchi Bangla\"]','[\"Mirchi Bangla\"]','[]','[\"personal update\"]','en','llama3.2:latest',0,'The post does not mention any of the strategic keywords (military, missile defense, naval, nuclear) and appears to be a personal update from an individual rather than a statement on a relevant topic.','{\"source\": \"yt-dlp\"}','2026-07-08 09:44:17','2026-07-08 04:45:39','2026-07-09 09:44:08'),(295,'instagram','https://www.instagram.com/p/DX42gCQsnVC/','DX42gCQsnVC','video',NULL,'The Maries',NULL,NULL,'Agni Parthene 💟\nIn this month of May, dedicated to